    <string name="about_software">About</string>
    <string name="about_back">← Back</string>
    <string name="about_credits_title">Credits &amp; Origins</string>
    <string name="about_credits_desc">Project lineage: TS6_Droid by flamme-demon (original) → TS6_Droid_CN by yuaxi (Simplified Chinese localization) → this repository (ongoing maintenance). Sincere thanks to the upstream authors for their outstanding contributions to the open-source voice community!</string>
    <string name="about_enhancement_title">Enhancements &amp; Maintenance of This Repository</string>
    <string name="about_enhancement_desc">This repository continues maintenance on top of yuaxi\'s localized version: 60+ issues fixed across permissions, audio, chat and file management; the floating-window permission flow and microphone controls were redesigned; trilingual translations were completed and unit tests with CI builds were added.</string>
