    <string name="about_license_desc">This project strictly follows the GNU GPLv3 (GNU General Public License v3) open-source license. This means any individual or team modifying or deriving redistributions from this project MUST keep it completely open-source, unconditionally adopt the GPLv3 license, and fully retain the copyright attribution of the original author (Grégory D), the localization developer (yuaxi), and the maintainer of this repository (wslinnn). Any form of closed-source packaging, secondary encryption, or secret profiteering is strictly prohibited!</string>
    <string name="about_repo_title">Official Source Repository &amp; Updates</string>
    <string name="about_repo_desc">The complete source code, version iterations and fix patches of this project are published independently in this repository; in-app update checks and downloads point to its Releases as well. Feel free to star, report issues, or submit PRs:</string>
    <string name="about_repo_link">🔗 Open this project\'s GitHub repository</string>
